{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907890/extras/24422f8b60206a0dcee6e3e7aeae9c98.avif?t=1756795936\" width=600 height=160 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf3e Build your dream farm in Outcity! \ud83c\udf3e</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The free preview version is now available!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outcity is a cozy sandbox farming simulator where you build your own countryside refuge from scratch. As a new settler, transform wild lands into a small, thriving, and personalized farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant, build, and shape every corner \u2014 <strong>and this is just the beginning!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907890/extras/c39e543f32e4be661dafab5805661e72.poster.avif?t=1756795936\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907890/extras/c39e543f32e4be661dafab5805661e72.webm?t=1756795936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907890/extras/c39e543f32e4be661dafab5805661e72.mp4?t=1756795936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf31 What you'll find in this preview version</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the <strong>foundation of your farm</strong> in initial territories full of possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore wild areas and collect resources to expand your property.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test the main systems: farming, fishing, mining, and customization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the creative freedom that will be expanded in the full version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f <i>This is just a sample of what's to come! Many biomes, crops, tools, NPCs, and extra mechanics will be available in the complete game.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907890/extras/c27a90b8d7b9836ca3ad9fe5f56ca3e6.poster.avif?t=1756795936\" width=600 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907890/extras/c27a90b8d7b9836ca3ad9fe5f56ca3e6.webm?t=1756795936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907890/extras/c27a90b8d7b9836ca3ad9fe5f56ca3e6.mp4?t=1756795936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfde\ufe0f Your countryside journey begins here</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The experience presents everything you need to feel the heart of Outcity:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31 <strong>Essential crops</strong> to start your agricultural production.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfde\ufe0f <strong>Initial territories</strong> filled with resources to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa3 <strong>Relaxing fishing</strong> in serene and peaceful lakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Fundamental tools</strong> to customize your farm to your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 Why try it now?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the heart of the experience before the official launch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the team with valuable feedback and suggestions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add <strong>complete Outcity to your wishlist</strong> and be notified when it's released!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd39 Availa